					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/buttfranklin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2721810); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2721810&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609818764" alt="Buttfranklin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2721810)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/buttfranklin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2721810); return false;" >Buttfranklin</a></span> <span class="odate time_1472564875 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">30 Aug 2016 13:47</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2580809">
									

<p>&#8230; jeezy petes. Who'da thought that a throwaway creepypasta about a 2spooky statue who breaks people's necks in a puddle of blood and poop would eventually give rise to something this high-brow? Look how far we've come, everyone. God damn.</p>
<p>So, let me preface the rest of my comment with an admission that this is a clever, marvellous, clever, clever piece of writing. What an idea! What an execution! As Mr Eldritch has done a fine job of explaining(/spoiling!) to us. But&#8230;</p>
<p>If anything, it's <em>stupidly</em> clever. And this is where my personal bias comes in. My own writing philosophy is quite unashamedly populist, and what you've written here is so damn smart that ninety-plus per cent of people are simply not going to get it at all. This thing is flying so far above most people's heads, it's not even in Earth orbit.</p>
<p>As was obvious from your casual use of the word &quot;pataphysical&quot;, I can tell that you don't give two hoots about some people not getting it. And I won't for one second judge you. I would never say that every single piece of media needs to have mass appeal in order to be good.</p>
<p>But you shouldn't be surprised if this doesn't break +100. In quality of the idea, and of the writing, and the hook, this blows most of the Top Rated Pages out of the water. But you've erected a big intellectual barrier to understanding this that not many readers will be able to climb.</p>
<p>However: +1 from me, with no hesitation</p>
<p>edit: <strong>NOM NOM NO M HUMBLE PIE DELICIOuOS</strong></p>

